questions.stem:
Consider the statement;
“Every day next week, Max will do at least one maths problem”
If this statement is not true, which of the following statements is certainly true?

parts.stem:
Show that, for any given positive integer \(k\),

if \((\lambda_k)^{k+1}-(k+1)\lambda_k+k\ge0\), where \(\lambda_k=\left(\frac{a_{k+1}}{G_k}\right)^{\frac{1}{k+1}}\)

then \((k+1)\left(A_{k+1}-G_{k+1}\right)\ge k\left(A_k-G_k\right)\)
